{
  "protocolVersion": 1,
  "kitVersion": "1.1.0",
  "sceneId": "huatai-procurement",
  "title": "华泰采购办理",
  "assistantMode": "HUATAI_ASSISTANT",
  "readiness": "poc-integrated",
  "notice": "本地 POC 流程：附件识别调用 DeepSeek 视觉 API；历史额度需按实际台账确认。完成本地办理不代表客户正式审批通过或已付款。",
  "pendingAdapters": [
    "customer-dictionaries",
    "external-payment-history",
    "external-approval"
  ],
  "workflows": [
    {
      "workflowType": "HUATAI_PURCHASE_APPLICATION",
      "resourceType": "HUATAI_PURCHASE_APPLICATION",
      "title": "采购申请单",
      "validationMode": "schema",
      "completionMode": "local-record",
      "instructions": [
        "这是采购申请，不是出差申请。优先确认固定资产、无形资产或维保费用，再选择演示费用细项。",
        "仅使用列出的字段和选项。缺失信息应询问用户，不能编造预算余额、科目编码或审批结果。"
      ],
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "title",
          "label": "申请标题",
          "type": "text",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "key": "company",
          "label": "申请公司",
          "type": "text",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "key": "department",
          "label": "申请部门",
          "type": "text",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "key": "applicant",
          "label": "申请人",
          "type": "text",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "key": "assetCategory",
          "label": "资产或费用大类",
          "type": "enum",
          "required": true,
          "options": [
            "固定资产",
            "无形资产",
            "维保费用"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "expenseDetail",
          "label": "费用细项（演示选项）",
          "type": "enum",
          "required": true,
          "dependsOn": "assetCategory",
          "options": [
            "电脑设备",
            "核心软件",
            "软件维保"
          ],
          "optionsByParent": {
            "固定资产": [
              "电脑设备"
            ],
            "无形资产": [
              "核心软件"
            ],
            "维保费用": [
              "软件维保"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "applicationAmount",
          "label": "申请金额（元）",
          "type": "number",
          "required": true,
          "minimumExclusive": "0"
        },
        {
          "key": "applicationDate",
          "label": "申请日期",
          "type": "date",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "key": "notes",
          "label": "申请说明",
          "type": "text",
          "required": true,
          "multiline": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "workflowType": "HUATAI_PURCHASE_REIMBURSEMENT",
      "resourceType": "HUATAI_PURCHASE_REIMBURSEMENT",
      "title": "采购报销单",
      "validationMode": "schema",
      "completionMode": "audit-adapter",
      "instructions": [
        "当前报销单的 linkedApplicationId 已选定且 selected_references.linkedApplicationId.status 为 RESOLVED 时，直接使用该申请，不能因其他同名候选而追问。只有未关联、原关联不可用或明确更换关联时，才从 reference_candidates 选择或询问目标。",
        "用户要求按关联采购申请回填对应信息时，来源为已选申请的 form：company 对应 reimbursementCompany，department、applicant、assetCategory、expenseDetail 对应同名字段。用户明确说金额与关联申请相同（包括“金额和我报销申请里的金额一样”）时，将来源 applicationAmount 写入当前报销单 taxInclusiveAmount，直接执行，不再追问编号或已给出的金额。优先用 value_from 引用来源字段。未要求金额相同时不默认把申请总额当本次报销额；不把申请日期当作发生日期，不因发生日期未填而阻止金额回填。",
        "报销标题可能涉及多期付款；不得只凭标题或金额认定付款条件已满足。提醒用户上传合同、发票与履约材料，识别后逐条关联合同期次。",
        "AI审校由用户点击独立按钮发起；本工具只填写表单，不能代替用户确认历史金额、人工复核或结束流程，不能声称客户正式审批或付款已执行。"
      ],
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "linkedApplicationId",
          "label": "关联采购申请",
          "type": "text",
          "required": true,
          "referenceWorkflow": "HUATAI_PURCHASE_APPLICATION"
        },
        {
          "key": "title",
          "label": "报销标题",
          "type": "text",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "key": "reimbursementCompany",
          "label": "报销公司",
          "type": "text",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "key": "department",
          "label": "申请部门",
          "type": "text",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "key": "applicant",
          "label": "申请人",
          "type": "text",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "key": "position",
          "label": "岗位",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "key": "assetCategory",
          "label": "资产或费用大类",
          "type": "enum",
          "required": true,
          "options": [
            "固定资产",
            "无形资产",
            "维保费用"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "expenseDetail",
          "label": "费用细项",
          "type": "enum",
          "required": true,
          "dependsOn": "assetCategory",
          "options": [
            "电脑设备",
            "核心软件",
            "软件维保"
          ],
          "optionsByParent": {
            "固定资产": [
              "电脑设备"
            ],
            "无形资产": [
              "核心软件"
            ],
            "维保费用": [
              "软件维保"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "taxInclusiveAmount",
          "label": "本次报销含税金额（元）",
          "type": "number",
          "required": true,
          "minimumExclusive": "0"
        },
        {
          "key": "occurrenceDate",
          "label": "发生日期",
          "type": "date",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "key": "notes",
          "label": "费用与付款期次说明",
          "type": "text",
          "required": true,
          "multiline": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
